@startuml
!theme plain
title Terminal Package Architecture

' === Color Palette & Style ===
skinparam component {
  ArrowColor #444444
  BorderColor #444444
  BackgroundColor<<Root>> #F5B7B1
  BackgroundColor<<Adapter>> #FDEBD0
  BackgroundColor<<UI>> #FEF9E7
  BackgroundColor<<Infra>> #F2F3F4
  BackgroundColor<<App>> #D5F5E3
  BackgroundColor<<Core>> #D6EAF8
  BackgroundColor<<Shared>> #E8DAEF
}
skinparam frame {
  BorderColor #888888
}

' === Legend ===
legend top right
  | Color | Layer Type |
  |<#F5B7B1>| Composition (Composition Root) |
  |<#FDEBD0>| Adapters (UIバックエンド/入力の具象) |
  |<#FEF9E7>| Presentation |
  |<#F2F3F4>| Infrastructure |
  |<#D5F5E3>| Application |
  |<#D6EAF8>| Domain / SharedKernel |
  |<#E8DAEF>| 全レイヤー共通のユーティリティ |
end legend

' === Components (Assemblies) ===
component "<b>Composition</b>\n(Composition Root)" as Composition <<Root>>

frame "<b>Adapters</b>" as AdapterFrame {
  component "Adapters\n(IMGUI)" as Adapters <<Adapter>>
  component "Adapters\n.UIToolkit" as AdaptersUIToolkit <<Adapter>>
  component "Adapters\n.CommandLine" as AdaptersCommandLine <<Adapter>>
  component "Adapters.Input\n.InputSystem" as AdaptersInputSystem <<Adapter>>
  component "Adapters.Input\n.LegacyInput" as AdaptersLegacyInput <<Adapter>>
}

frame "<b>Composition.Input</b>" as CompositionInputFrame {
  component "Composition.Input\n.InputSystem" as CompositionInputSystem <<Root>>
  component "Composition.Input\n.LegacyInput" as CompositionLegacyInput <<Root>>
}

component "<b>Presentation</b>" as Presentation <<UI>>
component "<b>Infrastructure</b>" as Infrastructure <<Infra>>
component "<b>Application</b>" as Application <<App>>
component "<b>Domain.Services</b>\n(Domain.Core)" as DomainServices <<Core>>
component "<b>Domain.Contracts</b>\n(Domain.API)" as DomainContracts <<Core>>
component "<b>SharedKernel</b>" as SharedKernel <<Core>>
component "<b>Composition.Shared</b>" as CompositionShared <<Shared>>

note right of AdapterFrame
  Adapters.UIToolkit は Adapters(IMGUI) を参照する。
  Adapters.Input.* は Composition からは参照されず、
  利用者のシーンへ直接アタッチして使う
  (autoReferenced/defineConstraints で切り替え)
end note

note bottom of SharedKernel
  上層レイヤーからの矢印を省いているが
  全てのレイヤー(アセンブリ)から依存される
end note

note bottom of CompositionShared
  SerializeInterface等の属性を提供する。
  Composition専用ではなく Infrastructure /
  Adapters / Composition.Input からも参照される
  (Infrastructure以外からの矢印は省略)
end note

note left of Composition
  図中の矢印は代表例。実際には
  Presentation / Infrastructure / Application /
  Domain.Services / Domain.Contracts /
  SharedKernel / Composition.Shared を
  すべて直接参照する
end note

' === Layout hints ===
Composition -[hidden]down-> AdapterFrame
AdapterFrame -[hidden]down-> Infrastructure
DomainServices -[hidden]right-> DomainContracts
SharedKernel -[hidden]right-> CompositionShared

' === Primary Relationships ===
Composition -down-> AdapterFrame : 具象バックエンドを選択・配線
Composition -down-> CompositionInputFrame

AdapterFrame -down-> Presentation
AdapterFrame -down-> Application
CompositionInputFrame -down-> Presentation

Infrastructure -down-> Presentation
Infrastructure -down-> DomainContracts
Infrastructure -right-> CompositionShared

Presentation -down-> Application
Application -down-> DomainContracts
DomainServices -down-> DomainContracts

DomainContracts -down-> SharedKernel
CompositionShared -down-> SharedKernel

@enduml
